   "question": "",
   "quote": "If another peer sends us the same tx later, this line replaces the saved peer and time. So `received_by_us` may not show the first peer that sent it back.\n\nShould we keep the first one?",
   "request": "Keep the first peer and time rather than overwriting received_by_us when another peer sends the same transaction later",
   "status": "fixed",
   "status_by": {
    "at": "2026-10-22",
    "by": "vasild",
    "id": "rc:4348848801",
    "quote": "Right, changed it to only set `received_by_us` if it is not set."
   },
   "status_note": "author agreed and changed code to only set received_by_us if unset",
